# DRAW keymap preset: Procreate (hardware-keyboard shortcuts, Procreate Handbook; Cmd = Ctrl)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on printable non-letters like > { + _ , typed with it).
#   A row that must leave Shift+key alone (Ctrl+] vs Ctrl+Shift+]) writes forbidMods 6.
#   Ctrl+Shift+punctuation is the UNshifted key with Ctrl+Shift: Ctrl+Shift+' = 39 3 (not 34).
#   Keycodes: letters are lowercase ASCII (Shift+letter = the letter, requireMods 2);
#   Tab 9, Backspace 8, Enter 13, Insert 20992, Delete 21248, F1 15104 ... F10 17408,
#   F11 34048, F12 34304. Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (that DRAW action loses the key)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Mac apps: Cmd is Ctrl here, Option is Alt.
# Procreate is touch-first: most of it is gestures (two-finger tap undo, touch-and-hold
#   eyedropper), and its keyboard set is small. DRAW's other keys stay.
# Already the same in DRAW (no row): B paint, E erase, V transform (Move), X previous colour
#   (Swap FG/BG), [ ] brush size, Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Shift+Z undo / redo, Ctrl+X / C / V,
#   Ctrl+D deselect, Ctrl+, settings.
# Not in DRAW (no row): Space QuickMenu (DRAW: Space pans), Ctrl+U hue / saturation,
#   Ctrl+B colour balance (stays Capture Brush), Ctrl+; perspective guide, M / Alt modify.
# DRAW keys this preset takes: S smart shapes (S = selections), L line (L = layers),
#   C ellipse (C = colours), { } music, Ctrl+0 reset zoom (Ctrl+0 = full screen),
#   Ctrl+J was free, Ctrl+E clear selection (moves to Ctrl+Backspace; Delete still clears).

112 115 0 0     # S             selections         -> Marquee
404 108 0 0     # L             layers             -> Layer Panel
2021 99 0 0     # C             colours            -> Color Mixer
601 91 0 0      # [             brush size -5%  (DRAW's own key, kept)
601 123 0 0     # Shift+[ ({)   brush size -10%
601 91 1 6      # Ctrl+[        brush size -1%
602 93 0 0      # ]             brush size +5%  (DRAW's own key, kept)
602 125 0 0     # Shift+] (})   brush size +10%
602 93 1 6      # Ctrl+]        brush size +1%
707 106 1 0     # Ctrl+J        duplicate to a layer above -> Duplicate Layer
306 21248 0 0   # Delete        (DRAW's own key, kept)
306 8 1 0       # Ctrl+Backspace  erase the layer / selection -> Clear Selection
403 34048 0 0   # F11           (DRAW's own key, kept)
403 48 1 0      # Ctrl+0        full screen        -> Toggle All UI
1703 107 1 0    # Ctrl+K        Actions menu       -> Command Palette
